OL,3,GDumfries, Galloway, Lothian & Borders
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FHeavy rain
OL,6,Fsoon clearing the east, then dry for a
OL,7,Fbrief time before frequent heavy
OL,8,Fshowers arrive through the evening and
OL,9,Fovernight. Becoming windy with Storm
OL,10,FBoelo bringing severe gales.
OL,11,
OL,12,CSunday:FStorm Boelo brings widespread
OL,13,Fwesterly severe gales, easing from the
OL,14,Fwest later in the day. Frequent
OL,15,Fshowers in the morning, heavy at
OL,16,Ftimes, with drier interludes
OL,17,Fdeveloping from the afternoon.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
