OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Monday to Wednesday:FDry
OL,6,Fand bright morning Monday, becoming
OL,7,Fwindy with rain later. Very windy on
OL,8,FTuesday with showers, some heavy.
OL,9,FWinds easing overnight into Wednesday,
OL,10,Fthen bright spells and scattered
OL,11,Fshowers.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
